ated_at":"2026-09-16T01:05:38.170-05:00","title":"A/I Shuts Down","url":"https://keepitfree.ai/announcements/a/i-shuts-down-stay-human/","score":92,"flags":9,"comment_count":54,"description":"\u003cp\u003eA/I is Autistici/Inventati, nothing to do with algorithms.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy this matters: to quote senior advisor and journalist \u003ca href=\"https://systemli.social/@anneroth\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eAnne Roth\u003c/a\u003e:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e20,000 mail accounts.\n20,000 blogs.\n5,000 mailing lists.\n1,500 websites.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Europe.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRun by volunteers of \u003ca href=\"https://systemli.social/@cavallette@mastodon.bida.im\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003e@cavallette\u003c/a\u003e, perfectly legal, and decidedly antifascist, feminist, queer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDestroyed and shut down by Trump's administration, extra legally.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is one of the most devastating cases of politically motivated debanking I have come across.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTriggered \u003ca href=\"https://lobste.rs/c/dv0zqn\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eby my own comment\u003c/a\u003e, I thought this might be a good starting point for a discussion about how to secure platforms not only technically, but also socially and financially.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMods: this is my first submission, feel free to tell me how to improve. I had a hard time choosing a tag, but I think this may be relevant to the community.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"A/I is Autistici/Inventati, nothing to do with algorithms.\r\n\r\nWhy this matters: to quote senior advisor and journalist [Anne Roth](https://systemli.social/@anneroth):\r\n\r\n\u003e 20,000 mail accounts. \r\n\u003e 20,000 blogs.\r\n\u003e 5,000 mailing lists.\r\n\u003e 1,500 websites.\r\n\u003e \r\n\u003e In Europe. \r\n\u003e \r\n\u003e Run by volunteers of [@cavallette](https://systemli.social/@cavallette@mastodon.bida.im), perfectly legal, and decidedly antifascist, feminist, queer.\r\n\u003e \r\n\u003e Destroyed and shut down by Trump's administration, extra legally.\r\n\r\nThis is one of the most devastating cases of politically motivated debanking I have come across.\r\n\r\nTriggered [by my own comment](https://lobste.rs/c/dv0zqn), I thought this might be a good starting point for a discussion about how to secure platforms not only technically, but also socially and financially.\r\n\r\nMods: this is my first submission, feel free to tell me how to improve. I had a hard time choosing a tag, but I think this may be relevant to the community.","submitter_user":"kolja","user_is_author":false,"tags":["finance","privacy"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/wxnibb","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/wxnibb/i_shuts_down"},{"short_id":"mmrtig","created_at":"2026-09-15T23:19:42.787-05:00","title":"Apple Reference Image: A New Approach for Verified Photography","url":"https://security.apple.com/blog/apple-reference-image/","score":13,"flags":0,"comment_count":9,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"strugee","user_is_author":false,"tags":["security"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/mmrtig","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/mmrtig/apple_reference_image_new_approach_for"},{"short_id":"zutlqt","created_at":"2026-09-15T22:47:55.703-05:00","title":"Some things Veloren does differently","url":"https://blog.jsbarretto.com/post/veloren","score":44,"flags":0,"comment_count":1,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"LesleyLai","user_is_author":false,"tags":["games","graphics","rust"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/zutlqt","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/zutlqt/some_things_veloren_does_differently"},{"short_id":"ynjgbz","created_at":"2026-09-15T22:39:05.470-05:00","title":"Ubuntu 26.10 completes transition to Rust-based coreutils","url":"https://www.omgubuntu.co.uk/2026/09/ubuntu-2610-rust-coreutils-complete","score":31,"flags":1,"comm